ross a large area."},{"answer":"fluently","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"He speaks French ___ (FLUENT).","hint":"adverb for \u0027speaks\u0027","explanation":"Adverb needed: fluently."}]}